<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hudson Timber year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hudson Timber year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.59 vs  0.61</p>
<p>    Net					0.83 vs  0.32</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     1.0  vs   nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     2.5  vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Sales				   91.86 vs 85.60</p>
<p>    Other income			   1.24 vs  0.65</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    3.1  vs  1.9</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 0.18 vs  0.07</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked  </p>
<p>Pay date May 30</p>
<p>Reg date March 6</p>
<p>    Tax					0.59 vs  0.22</p>
<p>    Interest expense		     0.68 vs  0.55</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   1.03 vs  1.00</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Hudson Timber and Hardware Ltd is a hardware retailer.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
